{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37237","headline":"浙西送杜晦侍御入关 · 章谒","name":"浙西送杜晦侍御入关","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫诏徵贤发帝聪，绣衣行处扑香风。\n鹗归秦树幽禽散，星出吴天列舍空。\n捧日思驰仙掌外，朝宗势动海门中。\n鞭鞘所拂三千里，多少诸侯合避骢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37237.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37237","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}